# TBA - Transfer B to A (opcode 0x17)

---
name: transfers B to A
memory: 17
setup: a=11 b=42
expect: a=42 N=0 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 1

---
name: transfers negative value
memory: 17
setup: a=11 b=80
expect: a=80 N=1 Z=0 V=0
cycles: 1

---
name: transfers zero
memory: 17
setup: a=11 b=00
expect: a=00 Z=1 N=0 V=0
cycles: 1
